guarantee: I8: the reason follows the ErrorKind (StorageFull -> disk_full)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/diag/log.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
            io::ErrorKind::StorageFull | io::ErrorKind::QuotaExceeded => {
                LogsUnwritableReason::DiskFull
            }
--- new
            io::ErrorKind::QuotaExceeded => LogsUnwritableReason::DiskFull,
--- end
